<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines has signed a new defence pact with Australia and concluded free-trade talks with Canada, deepening military and economic ties while hosting an ASEAN Maritime Center to improve regional coordination. Authorities in the Davao Region detained 67 foreign nationals for alleged illegal activities, and a scholar from Shanghai Jiao Tong University accused the Philippines of illegally occupying Ayungin Shoal during a heated exchange at the Manila Dialogue. Tensions with China persist as the country deepens military ties with Australia amid South China Sea disputes. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/16/trump-departs-for-asean-on-summit-with-xi-and-putin?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/15/australia-and-philippines-sign-new-defence-pact-amid-south-china-sea-tensions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/asia/trump-manila-asean-late.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/16/canada-carney-cars-evs-tariffs-xi-jinping-china-trump-trade-talks&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNLWtfU0tTallmSTNzSmZKOU9KVlRyalhxM1ZJaWphN3c0eHRIalJaUVNpWTdvTzRQWmZ4WHl6YW9qYmJwMUl1aDZIQlA3UGFBY21ka0xsbjNnWExMMWRJdzNkcFFjRnJpZVVoQmNLbm9xT0R0U2l0U3IzWlVEX3RENXNIQmJYWDQ0dnEyV2EzVFNVeS1rQWxMcTNuazVuODVtci02VmNvenFiSlg4em1PaWIwRkpkR0JH0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1XeVBEYmozamdmTXpQc2h1Tnp5TVZJeEU0dVVnQnd0VnRCc1dPU19FSHpjM0J1WjJVUWFLUE5SZjV5MzNn